msgstr "在本章节选对应的 commit 上，输出如下："

#: ../../part3-code-layer/ch09-parsing-and-entity-extraction.md:282
#: c9cfffc9884443ab80227a358c2670bb
msgid ""
"The ratio matters more than the absolute numbers: a healthy Go codebase is "
"function-heavy. If you see 5 000 \"functions\" on a 50 kLOC Java repo, your "
"parser is treating every closure as an entity — go fix the visitor."
msgstr ""
"比例比绝对数字更重要：一个健康的 Go 代码库是“函数密集”的。如果你在一个 50 kLOC 的 Java 仓库上看到 5000 "
"个“函数”，那就是你的解析器把每个闭包都当成了实体 —— 去修那个 visitor。"

#: ../../part3-code-layer/ch09-parsing-and-entity-extraction.md:287
#: 5eb79b871892435db585609d3cdea919
msgid "Conclusion"
msgstr "Conclusion —— 小结"

#: ../../part3-code-layer/ch09-parsing-and-entity-extraction.md:289
#: c52b62a43f36451b9f2cb161089303ed
msgid ""
"The parser is small, but everything in Part III depends on three contracts "
"it establishes: a uniform IR across languages (Claim 1), faithful source "
"coordinates on every entity (Claim 2), and an aggressive default skip-list "
"for vendored directories (Claim 3). Break any of the three and every "
"downstream chapter breaks with it."
msgstr ""
"解析器很小，但第三部分的每一层都靠它立下的三条契约活着：跨语言统一的 IR（主张 1）、每个实体都忠实保留源码坐标（主张 2）、以及对 vendor "
"目录的激进默认跳过名单（主张 3）。这三条哪一条破了，下游每一章也跟着破。"

#: ../../part3-code-layer/ch09-parsing-and-entity-extraction.md:295
#: 4fcdbc7bfc614cd6ad46c244118f8b7e
msgid ""
"Chapter 10 takes the IR as input and turns the *identity* half of each "
"entity (language, type, name, signature, docstring) into a vector — the "
"part, famously, where most code-RAG tutorials go wrong."
msgstr ""
"第 10 章把这份 IR 作为输入，把每个实体的 * 身份 * 那一半（语言、类型、名字、签名、docstring）变成一个向量 —— "
"这也正是众所周知、大多数 code-RAG 教程会走偏的那一段。"

